{"path":"utility/bitset/flip","title":"std::bitset<N>::flip","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::bitset&lt;N&gt;::</span>flip","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/bitset/flip","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Flips bits, i.e. changes true values to false and false values to true. Equivalent to a logical NOT operation on part or all of the bitset.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_1\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> flip<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">bitset<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> flip<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(constexpr since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Flips bits, i.e. changes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> values to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> values to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.   Equivalent to a logical NOT operation on part or all of the bitset.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Flips all bits (like <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset/operator_logic\">operator~</a></span>, but in-place).</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Flips the bit at the position <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the position of the bit to flip\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code> does not correspond to a valid bit position.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> flops<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> flops <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> flops.<span class=\"me1\">flip</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> flops.<span class=\"me1\">flip</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> flops.<span class=\"me1\">flip</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0000\n0001\n0101\n1010</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2250\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2250</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the behavior was undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code> does<br>not correspond to a valid bit position\n</td>\n<td>always throws an<br>exception in this case\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset/set\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>set</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets bits to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> or given value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset/reset\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reset</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets bits to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset/operator_logic\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&amp;=</span><span>operator|=</span><span>operator^=</span><span>operator~</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs binary AND, OR, XOR and NOT <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector_bool/flip\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>flip</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  flips all the bits <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::vector&lt;bool,Allocator&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/bitset","title":"std::bitset"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::bitset<N>::flip","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Flips bits, i.e. changes true values to false and false values to true."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"pos"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws std::out_of_range if pos does not correspond to a valid bit position."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"set","note":"sets bits to true or given value"},{"label":"reset","note":"sets bits to false"},{"label":"operator&=, operator|=, operator^=, …","note":"performs binary AND, OR, XOR and NOT"},{"label":"flip","note":"flips all the bits"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++23"],"wordCount":207,"codeBlockCount":2}
